cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the ICG-VIMOD paper and the
  software metadata below.
type: software
title: ICG-VIMOD
abstract: >-
  A dual-stream visible-infrared fusion object detector built on YOLO11.
  It consumes paired visible (VI) and infrared (IR) images and fuses the
  two modalities at the backbone and neck levels.
